WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.200
The main issue of increasing fiber intakes

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.970
is when you do that too quickly.

3
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.060
So someone who's not used

4
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.080
to a high fiber diet

5
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.880
suddenly has half a can of beans,

6
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.910
which can have up to 14 grams of fiber.

7
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.370
They could double their intake with a bean salad.

8
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:13.950
They will experience,

9
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.600
most people will experience some distress

10
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.570
in terms of bloating and gas,

11
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.470
farting and stuff.

12
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:19.960
That is really just because

13
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.100
you've gone from a low intake

14
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.150
to a much higher intake really quickly.

15
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.480
And beans are the classic one.

16
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.290
If you talk to beans about most people,

17
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.910
legumes, they're so high in fiber

18
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.940
that people will say,

19
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.770
oh no, I always get gas and bloat.

20
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.250
It's really just that change in fiber intake.

21
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.600
So if you make a decision for yourself

22
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.390
to consciously increase fiber intakes,

23
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.400
if you start to choose those whole grain products

24
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.670
over refined grains,

25
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.700
and actively eat more vegetables

26
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.640
with their skin when appropriate,

27
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.890
and have more legumes, nuts and seeds,

28
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.270
just do so at a slower rate initially.

29
00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.250
Don't go all in.

30
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.220
Don't suddenly triple your fiber intake,

31
00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.740
because you will experience some distress

32
00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.100
as that microbiome has to settle out

33
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.560
and start to flourish and control itself

34
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.120
with that sudden increase in food

35
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.330
that it can consume.

36
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.990
So that's my really only advice.

37
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.060
That's the only symptom I know,

38
00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.910
or negative, about higher fiber intakes.

39
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.510
It's if you do it too quickly.
